<p>The option uses <strong><code>tc-checked</code></strong>, not <code>tc-selected</code>. It is a radio, so it
follows the checkbox family of attributes and carries <code>aria-checked</code> too. The
label and description carry no state attributes, so style them through the
option.</p>
